---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: StarBlaze Ventures — Websites, Hosting, Cloud & Marketing, Fully Managed
description: StarBlaze Ventures builds, hosts, and grows digital-first businesses — websites, cloud, automation, and marketing, fully managed.
---
{% from "macros/card.njk" import card %}
{% from "macros/image-placeholder.njk" import imagePlaceholder %}
{% from "macros/button.njk" import button %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">Fully Managed Digital Growth</span>
    <h1>Your Business, Fully Online. Fully Managed.</h1>
    <p class="lede">StarBlaze Ventures builds, hosts, and grows digital-first businesses — websites, cloud, automation, and marketing, handled end-to-end so you can run your business instead of running your tech stack.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      {{ button("Explore Our Services", "/services/", "primary") }}
      {{ button("Talk to Us", "/contact/", "secondary") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="services-stack">
  <div class="services-stack__intro">
    <h2>Everything your business needs online, in one place.</h2>
    <p class="lede">From your first website to fully automated customer conversations — pick a service, or let us run the whole stack.</p>
  </div>

  {% set rows = services | batch(3) %}
  {% for row in rows %}
  <div class="services-stack__row" style="z-index: {{ loop.index }};">
    <div class="card-grid">
      {% for service in row %}
        {{ card(service.title, service.summary, "/services/" + service.slug + "/", service.imageAlt, "Learn more", service.image) }}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<script src="/assets/js/scroll-stack.js" defer></script>

<div class="band band--signature-wrap">
  <div class="band__inner signature-card signature-card--dark">
    <h2>One partner, not ten vendors.</h2>
    <p>Most small businesses end up juggling a web designer, a hosting company, a marketing freelancer, and a random cousin who "knows computers." StarBlaze Ventures replaces all of that with one accountable team — for your website, your cloud, your marketing, and everything in between.</p>
    {{ button("Learn About Us", "/about/", "secondary-on-dark") }}
  </div>
</div>

<div class="band band--signature-wrap">
  <div class="band__inner signature-card signature-card--cream">
    <h2>What we believe</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div>
        <h4>Fully managed means fully managed</h4>
        <p>We don't hand you a login and walk away — we keep things running.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Time saved, not time spent</h4>
        <p>Every service we offer exists to give business owners their time back.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Right-sized, not over-sold</h4>
        <p>We recommend what your business needs now, not the most expensive package we have.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<section class="band band--soft" style="text-align: center;">
  <div class="band__inner hero__inner">
    <h2>Ready to get your business online the right way?</h2>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;">Tell us what you're working with today, and we'll tell you exactly what it'll take to get you where you want to be.</p>
    <div class="hero__ctas">
      {{ button("Get in Touch", "/contact/", "primary") }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
